  <p style="text-indent:0;font-size:10pt;margin-top:18pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;min-width:fit-content;">Director Compensation</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p>
